"Use <b>Refresh Terms</b> to load them for chosen models, modules\n"
"               or languages (leave empty for everything). Every translatable\n"
"               term is collected — Python, JavaScript, QWeb, fields, views and\n"
"               menus — whether already translated or not."
msgstr "Koristite <b>Osveži termine</b> da biste ih učitali za izabrane modele, module\n               ili jezike (ostavite prazno za sve). Prikuplja se svaki prevodivi\n               termin — Python, JavaScript, QWeb, polja, prikazi i\n               meniji — bez obzira na to da li su već prevedeni ili ne."

